  "description": {
   "en": "A high school girl named \"Rai\" secretly has a crush on her childhood friend, Do-kyung. To hide Her feelings, she pretends to be a fan of idols. But her Secret Crush reaches its limits when the unexpected happens-her \"Favorite idol\" transfers to her school! Will Rai's one-sided love remain \"childhood Friends\" Relationship or turn into something more? As Jealousy sparks, Do-kyung starts to notice her differently. \"Why are you jealous? we're just friends\". A summer romance between Childhood Friends!"
  },
